# Accepted findings for the HIGH/CRITICAL supply-chain gate. Every entry needs a
# reason and an expiry date; Trivy fails the scan again once the date passes.

# Guava deserialization DoS (CVE-2026-102554) in the copy of Guava 32.1.2 that
# graphql-java shades into its own jar. No graphql-java release (through 26.1)
# ships a fixed copy, so it cannot be upgraded independently. Not reachable here:
# the vulnerable path is Java deserialization of Guava collections, and ForgeLoop
# never uses Java serialization (GraphQL input is parsed as JSON). Re-check when
# graphql-java updates its shaded Guava.
CVE-2026-102554 exp:2027-01-31
